{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_weedy_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_weedy_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"盐漠上的海风","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_weedy_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"2ac507cd2e2f5600ed5143c49485c815c0924a033199003f269a024cc9a89c7c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......温蒂小姐，我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这辆车是审判庭用来向各地执裁机构转运文件的专用载具，沿途不会受到太多盘查，我给您的那几封公函足够应付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车夫绝对信得过，但他能做的，也只是在途经边境地区的时候睡个午觉，时间不会太长......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这些钱。一切都打点好以后，我的积蓄只剩下这些了，拿着，回罗德岛的路上总归用得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，温蒂小姐。记住，您没有见过我，没有去过盐漠，没有去过雅隆镇，您当年离开后就再也没有回来过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后，也不要再回到伊比利亚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"两天前"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐，我们到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以为交接事宜涉及伊比利亚、阿戈尔和罗德岛三方，会在更正式的场合进行，比如已经重新亮起来的灯塔之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我明白了，审判庭是对我有顾虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，年轻人，你很聪明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛将在审判庭的监管下，将拆分后的天灾预警系统和医疗中心核心组件移交给阿戈尔的两位执政官保管......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亚与阿戈尔官方都不会记录这项交接，因此艾丽妮和西昆妲这两个老熟人都不便参与。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你作为罗德岛干员，又恰好身在伊比利亚境内，由你来负责相关交接事宜再合适不过。但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“但是，你涉嫌和强盗同流合污，在雅隆镇干涉审判庭的大人们执法”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说......“但是，在审判庭的卷宗里，你的爷爷，你的整个家族都是罪人”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张，温蒂小姐，那个时代已经过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但毕竟，那个时代也才刚刚过去。所以，必要的资质审查还是免不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该认识眼前的这栋建筑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷的仿生科技研究所......曾经的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭已经将与佩尼亚家族的研究相关的资料都送了进去，请温蒂小姐在两天内确认资料无误，以便我们最后封存......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之后，你就可以开始交接工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些资料积压已久，数量众多，所以我特意调拨了一个文书官过来......那家伙肯定能帮上你的忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这件事上能帮到我的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你见到他后会相信，审判庭是友好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，咳——咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老文书官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，忘了您对灰尘过敏......这里荒废太久了，我应该提前打扫一遍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利托爷爷，我以前来研究所看望爷爷的时候，见过您很多次，我记得您的洁癖比我还严重来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷还经常开玩笑，说阻碍第一科研秘书卡利托取代自己位置的，大概就是他的洁癖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您眼前的老家伙，如今只是审判庭一个最下等的文书官，温蒂小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是对这些资料比较熟悉，能帮上您，我甚至没有机会走出我的办公室......如果那算是办公室的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您是怎么变成了现在这副......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐，请、请别说那些了，让我们开始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭给您和我的时间都不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是佩尼亚家族所属的五间仿生科技研究所的查封公函——我们现在所处的正是其中之一——您确认无误后在末页签字就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是相关科研设备的销毁通知，请签字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些是......好多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得这些绘图模型和公式......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩尼亚家族所有与仿生科学研究相关的论文，发表过的，未发表的......共计三千七百八十二份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"复印件和发行件都已经回收销毁，您手里的这些是底稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光是底稿，摞在地上就快和我一般高了......这是爷爷和你们几十年的心血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大静谧后，审判庭立刻着手封停伊比利亚境内一切和海洋有关的研究，但佩尼亚所长的仿生科学项目一直坚持到了十多年前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比那成千上万个在某些夜晚被审判官闯进办公室像掐烟头一样掐灭的项目，我们、我们已经算得上幸运了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利托爷爷，您是这样想的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，温蒂小姐，还是一样，没问题的话在末页签字就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"废弃的研究所里，老人埋首于堆积如山的资料，他拿过一份份文件，简要总结后便递给温蒂。\n他始终低垂着脑袋，温蒂看不清他的表情。\n一个被繁冗事务磨灭了性子的老文书官就该是这副样子吗？温蒂想。\n寡言、死板、擅长忍耐，拒绝工作之外的沟通，看不出任何情绪，越来越......像是一台机器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“伯特、迪玛尔......为满足一己私欲，秘密进行已被审判庭封禁的实验，造成当地群众恐慌......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“......其罪甚恶，于颂圣棱堡监狱地块接受终身监禁。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"判决书......当年项目相关人员的判决书。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"听到那些名字的瞬间，老文书官的语气突然有了一丝松动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“多琳、卡斯特罗、莱姆......畏罪偷渡出伊比利亚，几人的尸体于盐漠被发现......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确认无误的话，温蒂小姐也需要在相应的地方签——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“克莱拉......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“窃取审判庭资料，倒买倒卖、私自传播官方机密实验数据......判处监禁十年......于颂圣棱堡监狱地块病逝。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱拉，是那位金色头发的黎博利女士？我记得她当初和卡利托爷爷您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）淡金色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱拉那时候刚从佩尔多尼来研究所不久，单纯、活泼、漂亮、富有感染力，所有人都想要和她说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一边帮我们整理各种数据，一边偷偷用我们做仿生实验用的海藻鼓捣出了一款染发剂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她每次经过我身边的时候，我总能从她的发梢闻到一股淡淡的清香，让人无端地想起......海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱拉女士不会是那样的人，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一定只是想将研究所的成果、所有人的心血尽可能保留下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐，那重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭封禁如此大型的科研项目，总需要一些理由来回应民众的质疑。至于真假，没有人会在意真假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可她是您的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有因为和克莱拉的关系、和您爷爷的关系而受到牵连，审判庭给了我一条活路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我心存感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心存感激吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，温蒂小姐！让我们赶紧回到正题上来吧，今天的任务还很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，卡利托爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一个需要确认的是......这是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"研究所核心实验项目的核心元件，在我们原本的构想中，由它支持的机器可以快速识别海洋生物的基因并刻录成样本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不应该、不应该......它不应该还存在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人终于从那如山的故纸堆前挪开了，他来到温蒂身边，接过了那个小小的元件。\n温蒂看见了他的表情——不可置信、恍然大悟、震惊、嘲弄、痛苦、哀伤......万千情绪写满了那张原本麻木的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“祸国殃民的研究”“荼毒人心的造物”“引诱海潮的信标”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭根本没有毁掉这个被他们打为祸端的东西......审判庭有意让我重新看见它，不，让你看见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们究竟想做什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利托爷爷，您还不打算开口吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并不在意审判庭的意图到底是什么，无非是试探、审查、管控——这套伊比利亚人早就习以为常的东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只在意您，卡利托爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信您会是一个麻木的傀儡。从您踏进这座研究所的那一刻起，我一直在等待......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待与您真正“重逢”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我已经让小叶确认过了......这里没有别人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——是来送您离开伊比利亚的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人攥住温蒂的衣袖，眼睛直直地看着她，尖锐而有力，像是突然变了一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就不该回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年，幸亏我们在审判庭有关系，佩尼亚所长提前听到了一些风声，他动用了能动用的所有人脉，送您离开了伊比利亚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以一种体面的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候我正好想要离开伊比利亚闯荡。在我的印象里，那个过程很顺利，只是帮我办手续的审判官跟我说，离开后便很难再回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都不重要了，温蒂小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别相信审判庭那些人跟您说的鳞屁话......“那个时代已经过去了”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，哪怕海洋和陆地已经重新建立了联系，哪怕您如今所在的公司已经能够进入伊比利亚开展业务......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但审判庭还是那个审判庭，他们的傲慢和专横不会变，他们的残忍和虚伪不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，这满地的卷宗和资料，还有这个本应被销毁的元件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我毫不怀疑，他们会在您处理完罗德岛的事务后，要求您遗忘曾经的一切，要求您重启研究所当年的仿生科研项目......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像，咳咳，咳——就好像他们犯下的那些罪孽、我们经受的耻辱和绝望，从来、从来都没有存在过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您别激动，您还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，从那个该死的家伙告诉我您回来了，把我叫来这里辅助您时我就决定了，我必须送您离开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人完全无视了温蒂的话，自顾自地说着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年，我的膝盖已经烂了，温蒂小姐。好在卑躬屈膝是有用的，我多少也算掌握了一些门路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来之前，我将所有的积蓄变卖，拿到了几封伪造的公函，可以应付沿途的盘查，该打点的关系也都已经打点好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上，我就送您离开伊比利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些动作不可能彻底瞒住审判庭，我们很快就会被发现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要您那时已经离开了这个国家就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可审判庭不会放过您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"错了，温蒂小姐——是我不会放过那帮渣滓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯特、迪玛尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多琳、卡斯特罗、莱姆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱拉，哦，我的克莱拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有您的爷爷，佩尼亚所长......研究所已经不复存在了，我们的科学已经不复存在了，除了满身的污名......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只剩下一个名叫卡利托的老家伙还守着这些废墟苟延残喘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在等一个合适的机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说，我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会送您离开，我会等着那帮执裁官或者审判官冲进这里，对我发怒，对我拔剑，就像他们曾经做过的那样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后——咳咳，然后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我会把自己的最后一口血啐在那帮渣滓脸上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人嘶吼着，嘶吼至声嘶力竭，但他依然紧紧握着那个核心元件，它尖锐的部分已经刺入他的手心，鲜血淋漓。\n可老人依然愤怒，仿佛他那孱弱的身体只能孕育这一种情绪。\n仿佛，是这种情绪支撑他......活到现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐，答应我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利托爷爷，我答应您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后，也不要再回到伊比利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快上车吧，温蒂小姐。我得尽快回到研究所，审判庭的人随时会赶过去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......小叶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小叶，将卡利托爷爷捆好，放进车厢里......小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放、放开我——温蒂小姐，您这是干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利托爷爷，钱和公函我给您放在旁边了，车夫先生我也已经打过招呼，他会稍微绕一点路，到时候会有我的一个同事接应您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个白发中掺着一缕红发，笑容灿烂爱开玩笑的黎博利男性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会送您回您的家乡......那个叫卢阿尔卡的小镇。我小时候就听您说过，那里靠近盐漠，晚上总有人围着篝火跳舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不能这样！在研究所的时候您明明答应得好好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，我骗了您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我当时不答应，您当即就会冲出去找审判庭的人拼命，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是罗德岛的干员，对接事宜关系到罗德岛的存续，我必须留在伊利比亚，完成我的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论审判庭所谓的“资质审查”里包含了多少深意，都由我自己去面对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐——温蒂——孩子！我的身体已经朽烂得像块木头了！我已经没几年好活了！就让我完成这最后的心愿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因为您没有几年好活了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利托爷爷，您没有发现吗，困住您这么多年的，除了审判庭，还有您自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得好几次去找爷爷时，听您说起加入研究所的初衷——您想象着我们造出了巨大的仿生的鳍，我们在海中自在航行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您现在回想过往，只剩下仇恨和痛苦，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望您回到自己的家乡，哪怕只来得及吹一吹盐漠上苦咸的“海风”，看一看盐鳞跃出盐层......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只来得及围在篝火边，和跳舞的年轻人说说话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只来得及躺在摇椅上，好好地、安稳地睡上一觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望您，从容地度过人生最后的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩尼亚家族的研究所，我爷爷曾主导的一切，无论它是审判庭所谓的罪孽，还是您口中的冤案，都让它随这辆车的离去而了结吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这一切就这么算了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小叶，跟卡利托爷爷道别吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仿生海龙在老人的身前摇曳，像是在舞蹈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐，难道说，这个仿生海龙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然比起你们曾经的技术积累，它还相当稚嫩，但小叶确实是仿生科技的产物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡利托爷爷，科学从不因被谁否定而断绝，也不靠被谁承认而延续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的方式，这是我与他们对话的姿态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡利托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，卡利托爷爷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"温蒂退后两步，拍了拍车厢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——车夫先生，启程吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人不再说话，他靠在车厢上，透过车窗看着温蒂和她身后的土地，而身下的载具渐渐将他拉远，直至视野里的一切都变得模糊。\n他怔怔地，仿佛从不认识那个纤细却坚强的女孩，不认识那片土地，不认识......他自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，小叶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我们有的忙呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮阁下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐临时提了一个条件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭永不追究卡利托文书官的所作所为？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想不出拒绝的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你误会了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请、请您示下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本次罗德岛天灾预警系统和医疗中心核心组件的移交工作，事关海洋与陆地，资质审查确实是必须的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但需要接受考验的，除了罗德岛的温蒂干员，还有你我——审判庭。不妨想想吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......身处一个新的时代，我们究竟应该如何面对过去，又该如何走向未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结束对温蒂干员的资质审查吧，她已经证明了——她不仅仅是一个“罪人的后代”，或者“有洁癖的科学家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
